{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "3B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-ii", "title": "滕文公下", "description": "陳代曰：「不見諸侯，宜若小然；今一見之，大則以王，小則以霸。且志曰：『枉尺而直尋』，宜若可為也。」\n孟子曰：「昔齊景公田，招虞人以旌，不至，將殺之。志士不忘在溝壑，勇士不忘喪其元。孔子奚取焉？取非其招不往也，如不待其招而往，何哉？且夫枉尺而直尋者，以利言也。如以利，則枉尋直尺而利，亦可為與？昔者趙簡子使王良與嬖奚乘，終", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "variants": [], "id": "仁"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "傅", "id": "傅"}, {"form": "兄", "id": "兄"}, {"form": "功", "id": "功"}, {"form": "古", "id": "古"}, {"form": "問", "id": "問"}, {"form": "室", "id": "室"}, {"form": "害", "id": "害"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "志", "id": "志"}, {"form": "數", "id": "數"}, {"form": "梓匠", "id": "梓匠"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "求", "id": "求"}, {"form": "父母", "id": "父母"}, {"form": "獸", "id": "獸"}, {"form": "率", "id": "率"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "祿", "id": "祿"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "輪輿", "id": "輪輿"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.1795250002368185, "source": "問", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.8213788864092133, "source": "問", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 1.4863778196768733, "source": "人", "target": "古"}, {"weight": 1.7740598921286541, "source": "人", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.4863778196768733, "source": "人", "target": "父母"}, {"weight": 1.4863778196768733, "source": "人", "target": "從"}, {"weight": 1.4863778196768733, "source": "人", "target": "數"}, {"weight": 0.5212969236332861, "source": "人", "target": "食"}, {"weight": 1.4863778196768733, "source": "人", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 2.1795250002368185, "source": "人", "target": "傅"}, {"weight": 1.0809127115687087, "source": "人", "target": "害"}, {"weight": 2.1795250002368185, "source": "人", "target": "獸"}, {"weight": 1.7740598921286541, "source": "人", "target": "率"}, {"weight": 1.0809127115687087, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {